    dct:description "numerical DDE period (T_m=7.18, T_p=1.80, a=4.5, b=c=0.23, k=33, p0=40, n=2, dt=0.02 min, peaks over [120,300] min) vs Box 1 law 2*(T_tot + ln2/b + ln2/c) = 30.01 min" ;
    dct:source "Lewis (2003) Current Biology 13:1398-1408 Box 1 (~30 min at 28 C); the Box 1 law is explicitly an approximation" ;
    rdfs:comment "the DDE runs 12.1% slower than the Box 1 estimate with the canonical parameters; her1-only (T_m=9.5, T_p=2.8) DDE period = 42.91 min" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
    schema:about "Danio rerio (zebrafish presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites); vendored SEM specimen is a chick-embryo cross-species proxy" ;
    schema:error 1.20667e+01 ;
    schema:targetValue 3e+01 ;
    schema:unitText "min" ;
    schema:value 3.362e+01 .

